,"MaxAttack":390,"InitialDefense":80,"MaxDefense":310,"InitialRegeneration":10,"MaxRegeneration":35,"AttackSpeed":100,"AttackRange":140,"KiGainInterval":630,"KiBaseFeed":15,"MoveSpeedToBuilding":1000,"WeaponType":21,"DefaultWeaponID":22000,"AttackWait":700,"ClassAbilityID":5018,"PotentialAbilityID":1100,"KiFeedLocationPlaceable":1}},"general_ability":{"id":100008,"name":"[天明]岐阜城特殊能力","description":"","effects":[{"AbilityType":1,"AbilityAreaType":3,"AbilityTargetType":15,"StatusModifierType":412,"Passive":1,"EffectValue":25},{"AbilityType":6,"AbilityTypeDetail":4,"AbilityAreaType":1,"AbilityTargetType":2,"Passive":1,"EffectValue":11},{"AbilityType":6,"AbilityTypeDetail":3,"AbilityAreaType":1,"AbilityTargetType":2,"Passive":1,"EffectValue":101},{"AbilityType":1,"AbilityAreaType":1,"AbilityTargetType":2,"StatusModifierType":51,"Passive":1,"EffectValue":80},{"AbilityType":1,"AbilityAreaType":1,"AbilityTargetType":2,"StatusModifierType":21,"Passive":1,"EffectValue":16},{"AbilityType":6,"AbilityTypeDetail":6,"AbilityAreaType":1,"AbilityTargetType":2,"Passive":1,"EffectValue":6032}]}},"dedicated_weapon":null,"max_renovation":1,"voice_actor":"大久保瑠美","flavor":["城下の栄えぶりはもう見たか？\n兜の介入を排した楽市による\n商いの自由化、工場による\n雇用の安定。末世でも遣様は\nあるわけだ。ぬ、疑り深いな。\nでは我自ら案内しよう、来い！","岐阜城は天守からの眺望が自慢\nでな。だが、見晴らしの良さは\n時に仇ともなる。包囲されれば\n兵の士気は下がり、合理的な\n見通しは希望を摘む……先が\n見えすぎるのも考えものよ。","蝮が下剋上を成した城にして、\n魔王が天下布武の志を世に知ら\nしめた城、それが我だ。さて、\n貴殿は我で何を為す。覇道、\n太平、はたまた……シシシッ、\n大いに楽しみなことよ。"],"introduction":"我は岐阜城、美濃を預かりし城娘だが――\nもっとも、城下町岐阜は\n自治によって運営されていてな。\n兜人分離を果たした自由な市に、\n新技術を設えた工場群を見るがいい。\n\nこれぞまさに、末世でも人が繁栄を掴み得る証左……\nシシッ、何か言いたげだな。\n良い、貴殿の話も聞きたかったところだ、\n金華山山麓のわが御殿へ案内するとしよう。\n\n庭の滝を眺めながら、ゆるりと茶でも飲んで\n天下の行く末を語らおうではないか、ん？","welcome":"貴殿が下剋上を志す異界の殿、か。\n面白い、この岐阜城が直々に天下布武の力を貸してやろう。\nだがもし相応しき器でなければ……シシッ。\nその時は、言うまでもあるまいな？","raw":{"CardID":898,"ClassID":1100,"Rarity":7,"Tokusei1":28,"VoiceID":888,"AreaType":6,"FavoriteThings":1,"DotScale":1.0,"HealthCorrection":110,"AttackCorrection":140,"DefenseCorrection":110,"RegenerationCorrection":100,"GrowUpID":2,"GrowUpLimitType":999,"AbilityID":9898,"AlwaysAbilityID":898,"GimmickID":898,"SpecialAttackID":898,"SpecialAbilityID":898,"CutInYCorrection":-200,"MaxRenovationCount":1,"RenovationType":5,"Renovation1AbilityID":10898,"Renovation1GimmickID":9898,"Renovation1SpecialAttackID":9898,"DependenceCardId":6898,"AutoProtect":1}}